# ================================
# IMPORTANT
# ================================
# Do NOT ignore DLL files.
# DLL files under Library/ remain trackable.
#
# Example:
# Library/
#   ├── MyLibrary.dll       <- NOT ignored
#   ├── MyLibrary.pdb       <- can be ignored if desired
#   └── logs/
#       └── application.log <- ignored by *.log